+Added `beacons.status` execution module function to report, for each currently configured beacon, when it last actually fired and whether that run raised an error. The status is tracked live as beacons execute (no new probe cycle, log reading, or minion restart required), and a beacon that hasn't fired yet is reported with `last_run: None` instead of a stale or made-up value.
